# Drevvy sources of truth

This repo is AutoAgent; the product brand is Drevvy.

Before changing MarketCheck MCP/API usage, inventory search, dealer workflow, monetization, events, or data architecture, read:

- `docs/drevvy/DREVVY_CONTEXT.md` — vision, business model, MarketCheck relationship
- `docs/drevvy/DREVVY_DATA_ARCHITECTURE.md` — data layers, MCP/API vs feed, events, IDs, engineering rules

If older AutoAgent docs conflict, these files win unless a newer written decision explicitly overrides them.

MarketCheck supplies the raw inventory/data layer. Drevvy owns search, ranking, the consumer relationship, dealer workflow, offers, analytics, and transaction intelligence.
